Installation intructions

 - You needs several ZIP archive to do the Heroes installation (from
   2 to 4 depending whether you want sound support or not).
   See http://heroes.sourceforge.net/download.html for details.

 - Unzip the all archives in the same directory.

 - Edit the file run.bat, change the first line to the directory
   where you installed the game (the default assume you unpacked
   the archives in the root directory of drive C:\), be sure to keep
   the `heroes\share\heroes' suffix.

 - Run `run.bat' (this setup the game to output 8bit audio at 11Khz, which
   could be better: you can tune this of course but I'm seeing weird
   behaviours if I change this on my machine...).

 - Documentation files are in the subdirectory `doc'. The manual
   is `doc\heroes.html' please read it before reporting bugs.
